{"3450120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Gears of Glory","steam_appid":3450120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Add to  wishlist<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/9c1a88cef605b197475a5d1adde9b8d2.poster.avif?t=1776968645\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/9c1a88cef605b197475a5d1adde9b8d2.mp4?t=1776968645\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>게임 정보<\/h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/513351b5c04b34c219707a2a657ce2a1.poster.avif?t=1776968645\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/513351b5c04b34c219707a2a657ce2a1.mp4?t=1776968645\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful towers, protect your base, and crush robots without mercy!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique towers, choose the best locations, and face increasingly difficult waves. Thinking fast and acting smart is the key to survival!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/24108c40e8514d8b7c8180444323759d.poster.avif?t=1776968645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/24108c40e8514d8b7c8180444323759d.mp4?t=1776968645\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\