static.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/77e05b3cc9ddccb5b0d576d765dc942f.mp4?t=1776968645\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/46a5c41b277321b4040db2245a3594c8.avif?t=1776968645\" width=1406 height=363 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your vehicle throughout the journey and turn the van into a true war machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost durability, speed, and impact, unlock defensive upgrades, and install an <strong>automatic sentry machine gun<\/strong> to eliminate enemies while you focus on driving.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/0175512132587254bbf0273a48e82112.avif?t=1776968645\" width=1410 height=363 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly dangerous enemies as you push forward through a living, hostile city.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps, survive unpredictable scenarios, and endure extreme situations — including a runaway train racing across deadly tracks, ready to crush everything in its path.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/273c22ed47332f06366a7e39a4ea91a1.poster.avif?t=1776968645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3450120\/extras\/273c22ed47332f06366a7e39a4ea91a1.mp4?t=1776968645\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 u